From e47396f92775b5f6f8ae92a0d0e8fbfe6364269a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gordan <gordan.radic@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 04:10:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] NBR: mpv stops depending on what this cut switched off, and
 drops the curl backend

Run 3 got past libvpl and died on curl, the same way: ninja stops, mpv never
configures, no artifact, run reports success. curl is there because upstream's
mpv.cmake lists it and our own options ask for it -- and it cannot build,
because the three fork patches that maintain its recipe (libpsl, curl, c-ares)
no longer apply to shinchiro's tree. They fail and the workflow swallows it.

-Dlibcurl is a "libcurl-based stream backend" in mpv's own words. NBR opens
files on disk, and what network protocols the engine has come from ffmpeg
through openssl. It was never chosen -- the generator recorded it as it found
it in August, when the fork's curl patches still applied. It is off now.

And mpv's DEPENDS is trimmed the way ffmpeg's was in 0101. This cut disables
64 of mpv's 68 options; only debug, libmpv, wasapi and (until now) libcurl are
on. Everything else in that list was being built so it could be ignored, and
each one is a chance to lose a whole run to somebody else's stale patch --
which is now twice.

The nine kept are The Bell's list, which built seven times on this same cmake
tree with a comparably cut mpv:

    ffmpeg libass libplacebo fribidi libiconv libpng harfbuzz freetype2 fontconfig

libass and libplacebo look odd in an audio-only build and are deliberate:
mpv's meson wants them present whatever the options say, and the remaining
seven are theirs.

Checked while here, since a stale option is the other way this build fails
silently: all 72 -D options we pass exist in mpv's own meson.options, bar the
five meson built-ins (b_lto, b_ndebug, c_args, debug, optimization).
---
 packages/mpv.cmake | 28 ++++++----------------------
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/mpv.cmake b/packages/mpv.cmake
index 8cec17d..b76d041 100644
--- a/packages/mpv.cmake
+++ b/packages/mpv.cmake
@@ -1,30 +1,14 @@
 ExternalProject_Add(mpv
     DEPENDS
-        angle-headers
         ffmpeg
-        fribidi
-        lcms2
-        libarchive
         libass
-        libdvdnav
-        libdvdread
+        libplacebo
+        fribidi
         libiconv
-        libjpeg
         libpng
-        luajit
-        rubberband
-        uchardet
-        openal-soft
-        mujs
-        vulkan
-        shaderc
-        libplacebo
-        spirv-cross
-        vapoursynth
-        libsdl2
-        subrandr
-        libsixel
-        curl
+        harfbuzz
+        freetype2
+        fontconfig
     GIT_REPOSITORY https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv.git
     SOURCE_DIR ${SOURCE_LOCATION}
     GIT_CLONE_FLAGS "--filter=tree:0"
@@ -121,7 +105,7 @@ ExternalProject_Add(mpv
         -Dx11-clipboard=disabled
         -Dxv=disabled
         -Dzimg=disabled
-        -Dlibcurl=enabled
+        -Dlibcurl=disabled
         -Dc_args='-Wno-error=int-conversion'
     BUILD_COMMAND ${EXEC} LTO_JOB=1 PDB=1 ninja -C <BINARY_DIR>
     INSTALL_COMMAND ""
